builder!) <br></li><li><strong>New Airstrikes</strong>: You no longer control the planes mid-flight. They go directly to their target and strike, much faster than previously. <br></li><li><strong>Huge balancing update and unit model improvements as well as UI tweaks and changes</strong>: for example, all units now accelerate and decelerate faster, with more streamlined, action packed RTS gameplay. </li></ul>",
